      "text": "$$ＡＧ$$\n「Who knows which club they'll end up helping...\n　And what awaits them, a storm or a thunderbolt?」",
      "status": "imported"
    },
    "stage0212_03:r_0abcaf0c31978670": {
      "text": "$$ＡＧ$$\n「Or so I say, stirring up a little anxiety.\n　Time to work hard today too... Business, business!」",
